{"c":[{"id":"beb30012ff315032","sum":"Cutoff: name the mechanism before the branch (unloaded dependency, or SQL cannot make the result). No schema version numbers. After a diagram, say why each branch exists, then the mechanics. Repeat the noun. v3.0.0 is c9fbcc4, PR 151. Do not rebase constrain-size-as-best-we-can.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"33748c759245c163","sum":"Migration cutoff: say the mechanism before the branch. A step can need a dependency the engine will not load, or SQL cannot make the result. No schema version numbers. After a diagram, walk each branch and say why before the mechanics. Repeat the noun; no 'that step' or 'it'.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T194315Z-636df94295e2a95b","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: explain a migration cutoff by the mechanism. A step can need a dependency the engine will not load, or the result can be something SQL cannot make. Say that before the branch. Do not use schema version numbers.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T194731Z-18fb669bc11e2a93","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: after a diagram, walk each branch and say why before the mechanics. Repeat the noun. Do not use 'that step' or 'it' for something named earlier.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4aec4ac4f2b51149","sum":"2026-10-23: M1-M3 shipped as v3.0.0 (c9fbcc4) via release-please PR 151. warehouse-file-growth restored memory-bank/active from the old branch onto main. Do not rebase constrain-size-as-best-we-can.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T210428Z-bfb74039999452c2","text":"2026-10-23: M1-M3 are on main as squash 0e1e62e. Ship them as v3.0.0 by merging release-please PR 151 before milestone 4. Then restore memory-bank/active onto a new branch from that main. Do not rebase constrain-size-as-best-we-can.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T211708Z-b30e35daac19f4be","text":"2026-10-23: v3.0.0 is c9fbcc4. warehouse-file-growth restores memory-bank/active from constrain-size-as-best-we-can. Milestone 3 is checked. Milestone 4 is Level 2, the read-only doctor storage report. Do not rebase the old branch.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"570fa3f21488d2c5","sum":"live_bytes unions persistent block ids, dropping ids below 0. Doctor probe uses RawDescriptionHelpFormatter so 'free disk' stays one phrase. copy_warehouse leaves warehouse.copy.duckdb; apply_pending gains through. View SQL is not compared across storage versions.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"c23945751b6b1fca","sum":"live_bytes is the union of persistent block ids, ids below 0 dropped. Doctor probe uses RawDescriptionHelpFormatter so 'free disk' stays one phrase.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T220226Z-0a3553df5a1ac252","text":"2026-10-23: warehouse-file-growth at 36b3c4d is main plus the memory bank. Milestone 4 doctor storage report passed preflight with an advisory. live_bytes stays the union of persistent block ids, dropping ids below 0. Build has not started.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T224558Z-a0c4edb3a448542b","text":"argparse's default help formatter replaces a space with a newline, so a two-word --help assertion can fail. Doctor probe uses RawDescriptionHelpFormatter so 'free disk' stays one phrase.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"54a433b5bbf07253","sum":"copy_warehouse leaves warehouse.copy.duckdb. apply_pending gains through. View SQL is not compared across storage versions.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261024T001536Z-49fa9d2f5324eb68","text":"2026-10-23: Milestone 4 doctor storage report is checked after reflect. Milestone 5 verified newer-format copy is Level 3. Plan has not started.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261024T002339Z-883a096b1bb38717","text":"2026-10-23: Milestone 5 plan writes copy_warehouse, which leaves warehouse.copy.duckdb. apply_pending gains through. View SQL is not compared across storage versions. Preflight has not run.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
